<title>GERMANY: Continental says Q1 sales, profit rise.</title>
<headline>Continental says Q1 sales, profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  2,520   up 1.4 pct</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax earnings		   88	vs 75</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German tyre manufacturer is Continental AG.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
